                "loc": "DAN.4.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 4:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bali na wafunikwe nguo za magunia, mwanadamu na mnyama pia, nao wakamlilie Mungu kwa nguvu, naam, na wageuke, kila mtu akaache njia yake mbaya, na udhalimu ulio mikononi mwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni nani ajuaye kwamba Mungu hatageuka na kughairi, na kuiacha hasira yake kali, ili msiangamizwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungu akaona matendo yao, ya kuwa wameiacha njia yao mbaya. Basi Mungu akalighairi neno lile baya, ambalo alisema atawatenda; asilitende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
